{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c42c48a133cd86c13f26e4ee6ce887f3ea63a4b35e05664bf381cca5584ff2f7", "ja": "戦わずにいられない", "zh": "不得不战", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "70fb2071a2a053d9752d001fbf2ff90809745d69f71afc41c59d5de176c5d109", "ja": "真が言った「静香はもうみんなと戦う理由が\nある」の意味を考えていた静香。「真っ先に\n未来と翼の事を思い出したのは、ふたりが\nライバルだからだ」というプロデューサーの\n言葉に、ようやく全てを納得する。", "zh": "静香一直在思考真所说的“静香已经有了与大家战斗的理由”是什么意思。制作人说：“你第一个想到未来和翼，是因为她们是你的对手。”听到这句话后，静香终于明白了一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb2a0abb77f3c6a7bb76eaf6ba10662a38e5d99446fad1ea47325f8c5be5d3f8", "ja": "（開催宣言公演の準備が進んでいる。忙しさで、\n本番が近づいてるっていう実感が湧いてくるな……）", "zh": "（开场宣言公演的准备工作正在推进。忙碌之中，终于有种正式演出越来越近的实感了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1001_null", "source_sha256": "b437ffc0d45172b7b137b77fb8c6233537dead82c70400771fce1ce09a8be304", "ja": "コンコン……ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚……咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "c0407f172eb00106fa6db5bf73a30a4b9fea08ce74514e32b7154f22cd09cff3", "ja": "失礼します、{$P$}。", "zh": "打扰了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "191f09dd64002f4d24ed837b411d2af132696671f59cb1597ae05f346b02516c", "ja": "はい？　ああ、静香か。\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯？啊，是静香啊。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "9a629905fbe29e3ec7e0755b09f174248d75a86bc5f296ace89dee1cb0927c12", "ja": "えっと、ちょっと相談したいことがあって……。\n今、大丈夫ですか？　ダメなら出直しますけど。", "zh": "那个……我有件事想和您商量……\n您现在方便吗？要是不方便，我之后再来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "427d91be541b448f382e4557a57f42251f95bf231cc40dc4886ffee8886a6ca2", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。\nもしかして、戦う理由についての話？", "zh": "没问题。\n难道是关于战斗理由的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "624cde43b5517b1a71170f42ecd6822e095b5118b41366a69cd79ba3ba3a3bc9", "ja": "はい。みんなと色々やってみて、気付いたんです。\nどの考え方にも、理解できるところはあるって。", "zh": "是的。和大家一起尝试了各种事情后，我注意到了这一点。\n每种想法都有能够理解的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "e385b49de73299606c3d9c5aebaf284a90e96f9250ce595e3821de62258c2acc", "ja": "自分との戦いとか、楽しむためとか……\n理解はできるんです。でも今回は、しっくりこなくて。", "zh": "比如与自己战斗，或是为了享受……我都能理解。但是这次，总觉得不太对劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3854c873d2810f17e3d05cfeea9af4ca82db9732a623ea1050c671d17bc0255b", "ja": "ふむ……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "f4f710d3939ee76461026a2b97b5350d889ffc8bb798ebaf14e33772867f8668", "ja": "これまで、未来や翼、劇場のみんなと、\n色々なことを乗り越えてきました。", "zh": "至今为止，我和未来、翼，以及剧场的大家一起克服了许多困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "24b11fbd00bcfb4becca7f76eb990fd0a73974c2896954be9269621293df14b9", "ja": "戦えと言われれば、戦えるんです。でも、そこに\n強い気持ちを乗せるには、どうしたらいいのかなって。", "zh": "如果有人要我战斗，我也能战斗。但是，要怎样才能让自己带着强烈的心情去战斗呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "d413be50d59e530b3f2b8d1de792d37fc60d3446485f6ae6704de6607adda763", "ja": "真さんは、私にはもう、みんなと戦う理由が\nあるって言ってましたけど……。", "zh": "真说过，对我来说，已经有了和大家竞争的理由……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1930b50825dc07932c689602bcf49bc4411d0aa89adb690eb7cdf79e886390aa", "ja": "なるほど。まあ……真が言いたかったことは、\nなんとなくわかるかな。", "zh": "原来如此。嗯……真想表达的意思，我大概明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "cb3b1fe404cc6213b58cd077b1ced838f1ff497ab4e37f05442a656b05fdb9d5", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？　……本当に？", "zh": "诶，真的吗？……真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ec994756b30cbf1096c8a243f1dc35870bb83dc10a122dbd548e342e10cfa344", "ja": "なんとなくだけど。静香は今回の話を聞いて、\n真っ先に未来と翼のことを想像してたんだよな？", "zh": "虽然只是我的感觉。静香听到这次的事后，第一时间想到的就是未来和翼，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b53c15d8694c3054c6fba52d12556fe133c862c70e3337009c191be93663a9e0", "ja": "それは結局、ふたりを意識してるからだと思うんだ。\n戦うべきライバルとして。", "zh": "我觉得，归根结底，是因为你很在意她们两个人吧。\n把她们当作应该与之较量的对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "你的意思是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "34282a7fe80957e92579537ddaa4016d073b6b53e064fb2b331077d255edf466", "ja": "真もずっと、春香や千早、美希や伊織達と競い合って\nきた。意識して、認めて。でも、負けられない……。", "zh": "真也一直以来都在和春香、千早、美希、伊织她们竞争，\n在意她们，也认可她们。但是，不能输……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0e6307e0925c15e372311661c58b9b7e0d38f191fca1c0ea0d9236c63897a65e", "ja": "そんな気持ちは、誰よりもわかるんだと思うよ。\n静香も、負けられないって思った事はあるよな？", "zh": "我觉得这种心情，我比任何人都更能理解。\n静香也有过觉得自己不能输的时候吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "e7af0942d27d1b2a64966e64a318becf3f069a51d6dec446d276dfd5d3f7d711", "ja": "もちろん、あります。", "zh": "当然有过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "cfce482d845909b32cfb745dfef3f1fe67e16ed367f45defcfb6f8b4e4962e61", "ja": "だったらそれは、ライバルって事なんじゃないかな。\n負ける事が怖くて、差を突き付けられるのが怖くて……", "zh": "既然如此，那不就是所谓的对手吗？\n因为害怕输掉，害怕被迫直面差距……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "fa2375103c7a49cd6a70b6ba8fe1b2d91602a0167e17ca44b206f16213eed240", "ja": "目を背けたいけど、ずっと意識してしまう存在。\nそういう相手だからこそ、戦わずにはいられない。", "zh": "明明想要移开视线，却总是会在意的存在。\n正因为是这样的对手，才无法不与之战斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2c1c163d464ed7796f70c2558ddf9fad3faa68f18c8cd6fc1ff6690fd932d23", "ja": "戦わずに、いられない相手……。", "zh": "无法不与之战斗的对手……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "da0726c0f44db5591f7d9f3320089b424987615e03f633ae1232d87def73806e", "ja": "うん。それに、戦いたくないと心から思える\n相手だからこそ、戦う価値があるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "嗯。而且，正因为对方是让你由衷不想与之为敌的人，\n才更有交手的价值，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b2cf4bb3a80cd3720d4cc9e44ed34804455b2c521d7bd523465cc436944fef8a", "ja": "本気でぶつかり合って、競い合って、高め合える……\nそんな仲間は、そうそう得られないと思うよ。", "zh": "能够认真碰撞、相互竞争、共同提升……这样的伙伴，可不是那么容易遇到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "1b5332b6e2eab3e5fe93c631afc7764983a7e028c83bb6ed4f07e3851a6e85a4", "ja": "……。\nそっか。私、ずっと……。", "zh": "……。\n是吗。我一直都……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1026_null", "source_sha256": "8eb363af7a4988b86bfee0510c7f10ec1d6443e74df9ed837c329ebe0e386b59", "ja": "ガチャ！", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1027_006mak", "source_sha256": "7214d57c28df89f2e32a8b9253abd3efb872acdf194e959e9c198ac1344e907a", "ja": "それだーっ！", "zh": "就是那个——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "f0680ce79fca90172184e8f52b7e7ffbd1d362ea436908be84d976f77fd6c760", "ja": "えっ！？　……真さん！？", "zh": "诶！？……真同学！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "3d7a74bb23aed93c968b7fc04b0ac47fb1f152b003b8712ef827c2019ccfa1cc", "ja": "それですよ、{$P$}！\nボクが言いたかったこと。いやー、さすがだなぁ！", "zh": "就是这个，{$P$}！\n这就是我想说的。哎呀，真不愧是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7e760edb527bd88da3fcdf4e19d0cd9e4b429ecaecbfa28b1763326757ef3c29", "ja": "なんだ、聞いてたのか。", "zh": "原来你听到了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "960515c6fbb847fe8f225ec60617ee0bd758c750fb26a280bbb7b6e37a174819", "ja": "すみません！　帰りの挨拶に来たら、なんだか\n話し込んでたから、つい……静香もゴメンね。", "zh": "对不起！我本来是来道别的，可看你们聊得正起劲，就忍不住……静香，也对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "c30ad5af78adbf49b5e1a06e14555e5dc7e27eb05cb7a56bf933f0189b76f201", "ja": "いいんです。真さんの言ってくれたこと、\nちゃんとわかって、よかったです。", "zh": "没关系的。能好好理解\n真小姐对我说的话，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "9e99723bb7480982333584d359aebc1fd45c4e01eb52dae889cd02e5da9ae62b", "ja": "{$P$}も、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}，也谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "0d8004f3ffe37e99906720535b7e43bcfb5fa62dd3113bb0ecbe08e1326f10a7", "ja": "うん、吹っ切れたみたいだな。よかった。", "zh": "嗯，看来是彻底想通了呢。太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1035_006mak", "source_sha256": "d853e2380c7f8e073bbc7af32b44621ea39c15d2cc585c2ec0106f1f7c56079e", "ja": "へへっ♪　あ、そうそう！　それとね、\n静香に一つだけ、言っておきたいんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　啊，对了！还有啊，\n我有一件事想跟静香说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "1980ad9f9fbd651b5c004882ec845c9e1cebaa0595c8acdf69758aa564e0827f", "ja": "え？　はい、なんでしょうか？", "zh": "诶？好的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "792dda4beeec7cdee3ed3c246e067f0934f905ed8dbcaec9dd7cdfd42f9add04", "ja": "静香、未来や翼のことばっかり意識してる\nみたいだけど。ボクのことも、忘れないでよね！", "zh": "静香好像光顾着在意未来和翼她们了。可别把我也忘了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "468ed6e2b5bed3d9de33a526a1039d951c52f633a2192bee5e5fb2084b95f4b1", "ja": "ううん！　ボクだけじゃない。\n環も朋花も、エミリーも麗花さんも、みんな。", "zh": "不对！不仅是我。\n环、朋花、艾米莉还有丽花小姐，大家都是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1039_006mak", "source_sha256": "d1952471e4df25686ab63990a6447f3ec3ea5bf775959a0279ee799f3a3df7b7", "ja": "みんなもきっと、静香と本気で競って、ぶつかって……\nそれで、「一番輝きたい！」って思ってるはずだよ！", "zh": "大家也肯定都想着要认真地和静香竞争、碰撞……\n然后，“成为最闪耀的那一个！”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "9ce914cff7168b78d3aef143107f333fbca1ef792312a07d5b62671d58a7b58b", "ja": "真さん……ありがとうございます！\n私も、やっとまっすぐ、そう思える気がします。", "zh": "真……谢谢您！\n我好像也终于能坦率地这么想了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1041_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc625f55a5a36451068d1187e716a370b0d6be6abd620e8f9545337d9c77540f", "ja": "本気で……みんなと、戦いたいです。", "zh": "我真的……想和大家一决胜负。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1042_006mak", "source_sha256": "318ca801a3b92e467dd54cf288eea3e549e95d246839097a017e4a567f9c9c12", "ja": "うん、戦おう、静香！\nボクも本気で挑むから……手加減なしだ！", "zh": "嗯，一决胜负吧，静香！\n我也会全力以赴……绝不手下留情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0378_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0378_story_05_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "1aec77a4c03b38690c1af09dce6b4ea9ea5f68723df4554d3ce14068ff758ab0", "ja": "はい、望むところです。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的，正合我意。\n我才要请您多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
